<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African money mkt shortage dips to 9.74 bln rand.</title>
<headline>S.African money mkt shortage dips to 9.74 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage dipped to 9.736 billion rand on Wednesday from 9.851 billion rand on Tuesday, the Reserve Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
